        "filename": "include/benchmark.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 81,
      "author": {
        "id": 1534724
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-25T16:24:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did this because I wanted to:\n\n1. Update the `results_` so I can print all the numbers from `print_results()`. \n  * If I omit the `\u0026`, I think I\u0027ll get a copy of the `BenchmarkResults` and won\u0027t update the content of `results_`.\n1. Return a copy of the numbers so that the test can `TEST_ASSERT()` their values.\n\nMaybe there is a better way to accomplish this?",
      "parentUuid": "e0d424a7_d0f4b4c2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 81,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 81,
        "endChar": 25
