      "writtenOn": "2022-10-25T16:40:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. This should be ok. I was worried that we were returning a reference, but we\u0027re returning `std::optional\u003cBenchmarkResult\u003e`, so a copy should be made.",
