      "message": "We\u0027re already hardcoding the width (`16`, `15`, etc.) in the first `ccprintf` and `print_result`, so would it work to remove the define and change it to something like:\n\n```\nconstexpr const char kSeparator \u003d \"-------------------------------------\";\n\nccprintf(\"%16s | %15s | %13s ...\\n\", kSeparator, kSeparator, ...);\n```\n\n(When possible I try to avoid macros and looks like the [style guide agrees](https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html#Preprocessor_Macros).)",
